    "pin actual caller, immutable request/candidate, evidence cutoff, authority, and optional worktree identity",
    "direct named or unambiguous leaf → load one leaf; no fork",
    "material route ambiguity only → F-T1 then optional F-T2",
    "load one leaf or return NONE",
    "return artifact to actual caller; no automatic composition, diagnosis, implementation, or action",
    "model-combination only after a named primary-frame blind spot; plan-arbiter only for fixed competing plans"
  ],
  "forks": [
